      "side": 1,
      "message": "Such errors usually mean, that there is probably something missing from DTS or you are referring to DTS incorrectly.\n\nYou are using Egis630 emulator here. First step would be to check if the `EMUL_EGIS630` config is set (in the `.config` file).\n\nSPOILER ALLERT:\nIt is not set because of `DT_HAS_FPC_EGIS630_ENABLED`.\n```\nconfig EMUL_EGIS630\n\tbool \"EGIS630 fingerprint sensor emulator\"\n\tdepends on ZTEST \u0026\u0026 DT_HAS_FPC_EGIS630_ENABLED \u0026\u0026 ARCH_POSIX\n\tdefault y\n\thelp\n\t  This option enables the EGIS630 fingerprint sensor emulator.\n\t  It supports only basic commands (get hardware id, enter low power\n\t  mode) that can be issued by the public driver (without FPC private\n\t  library)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "da3b27e2_c71bcb3f",
      "revId": "8353fa4032971fea43f5eab201c8ddee0cc2fa26",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
